. A theme is easy to install, easy to sw"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"itch, easy to customize, consistent across UI states, comfortable during long coding sessions, and i"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ndependent from agent logic. The token contract is docs/theme-spec.md."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Community themes are welcome — docs/creating-a-theme.md is the ordered guide. Standing orders live i"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"emes are welcome — docs/creating-a-theme.md is the ordered guide. Standing orders live in AGENTS.md."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Participation follows the Code of Conduct. Report vulnerabilities privately through the security pol"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"icipation follows the Code of Conduct. Report vulnerabilities privately through the security policy."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
